Third-party components bundled or downloaded at runtime

ffmpeg / ffprobe
  Sidecar binaries fetched from eugeneware/ffmpeg-static (b6.1.1).
  FFmpeg is typically licensed under the GNU GPL. See
  https://ffmpeg.org/legal.html and the ffmpeg-static release notes.

whisper-cli
  Built from ggml-org/whisper.cpp (MIT).
  https://github.com/ggml-org/whisper.cpp

ggml-small.bin
  Whisper "small" weights, downloaded at first transcription into app data
  (not shipped in the installer). Upstream:
  https://huggingface.co/ggerganov/whisper.cpp
  Converted from OpenAI Whisper (MIT).

Other Rust crates and npm packages
  See src-tauri/Cargo.lock and package-lock.json for versions and licenses.
